{title: Dheere Dheere Pyar Ko Badhana}
{artist: Kumar Sanu Anuradha Paudwal}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] [F],        Dheere dheere pyaar ko badhana hai
[C] [G],        Had se guzar jana hai
[G] [F],        Mujhe bas tujhse dil lagana hai
[C] [G],        Had se guzar jana hai
[G] [Am],        Aisi zindagi hogi, har taraf khushi hogi
[F] [C] [G],        Itana pyar doonga tujhe, aye mere sanam
[C] [Am],        Ab na koi gham hoga, na ye pyar kam hoga
[F] [C] [G],        Sathi mere mujhko tere sar ki hai kasam
[G] [F],        Ik dooje ko aazamaana hai
[C] [G],        Had se guzar jana hai
[G] [Am]
Mai akela kya karta, aise hi aanhe bharata
[F] [C] [G],        Tere pyar ke liye, tadapata umra bhar
[G] [Am]
Jaane kya mai kar jaati yun tadap ke mara jati
[F] [C] [G],        Bin tere bhala kaise, katata yeh safar
[G] [F],        Tere liye mar ke bhi dikhaana hai
[C] [G],        Had se guzar jana hai
[G] [Am]
Tera chand sa mukhada, tu jigar ka hai tukada
[F] [C] [G],        Tu hamare sapnon ki jhil ka kanval
[G] [Am]
Jaan se tu hai pyara, aankho ka tu hai tara
[F] [C] [G],        Bin tere jiyenge ab hum na ek pal
[G] [F],        Sab kuchh tujh pe hi lutaana hai
[C] [G],        Had se guzar jana hai
